  "about": "Nathan's Economy Read Chain: the fixed indicator set per economy. Releases (days) -> Themes (weeks) -> Rates & Yields (months) -> Performance. impact 'up' = a rise supports the currency (green); 'down' = a fall supports it (unemployment, claims). Live jobs fetch exactly these.",
